lIrreflexiveRelation}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rel\\text{-}irreflexive\\text{-}relation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRelIrreflexiveRelation}_S(R,X)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{RelationOn}_S(R,X)\n\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(\\langle x,x\\rangle\\notin R).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rel\\text{-}irreflexive\\text{-}relation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRelIrreflexiveRelation}_S(R,X)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{RelationOn}_S(R,X)\n\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(\\langle x,x\\rangle\\notin R).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Irreflexivity is stated only after verifying that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> is a binary relation on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-zfc-relation-on.md","status":"resolved","id":"41276343f41b253b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-relation-on.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-zfc-relation-on.md","status":"resolved","id":"41276343f41b253b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RelationOn}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[../batch14/58-df-zfc-relation-on.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"R,X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RelationOn}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRelIrreflexiveRelation}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rel\\text{-}irreflexive\\text{-}relation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRelIrreflexiveRelation}_S(R,X)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{RelationOn}_S(R,X)\n\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(\\langle x,x\\rangle\\notin R).","display":true},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false}],"bytes":916,"backlinks":[{"id":"389fd939db120343","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcRelIrreflexiveRelation}_S\\subseteq V^2$（参数顺序为 $(R,X)$，see [[../batch01/58-df-zfc-rel-irreflexive-relation.md]]）"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3314","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-rel-irreflexive-relation.md|58-df-zfc-rel-irreflexive-relation]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","41276343f41b253b"]}